      "name": "Why the Scale Stalls",
      "char_file": "베개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "You cut portions and walk more,",
        "but the body fat will not move",
        "",
        "NIDDK lists sleep, medicines and",
        "health conditions as weight factors —",
        "3 of them get missed most often"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cause 1: Short Sleep",
      "char_file": "베개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Adults 18 to 64 need",
        "7 to 9 hours a night",
        "",
        "Too little sleep can disrupt",
        "the hormones that control appetite,",
        "and adds more waking hours to eat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix the Sleep Gap",
      "char_file": "베개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Count your actual hours",
        "for one week before anything else",
        "",
        "If you land at 5 or 6, that is",
        "the cheapest thing on this list to fix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cause 2: Your Medicine Cabinet",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Steroids, some antidepressants,",
        "insulin, beta-blockers, antihistamines",
        "",
        "NIDDK lists all of these among",
        "medicines that may add weight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix the Medication Question",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Never stop a prescription",
        "on your own — ask instead",
        "",
        "\"Is weight gain a side effect of this,",
        "and is there an alternative for me?\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cause 3: The Fiber Gap",
      "char_file": "아몬드_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Americans average about",
        "16g of fiber a day",
        "",
        "The recommendation is 21 to 38g —",
        "and fiber is what makes you",
        "feel full faster"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix the Fiber Gap",
      "char_file": "아몬드_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "100g of cooked chickpeas:",
        "7.6g fiber, 8.9g protein, 164 kcal",
        "",
        "Add fiber gradually over weeks",
        "and drink plenty of water"
      ]
    }
